# Egg ghost (달걀귀신): a faceless, egg-headed ghost from Korean folklore,
# here in a white durumagi coat. Side view, faces right. The "crack" frame
# splits the egg to show an eye: use it once, as a scare.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 24 40
@output ../characters/creature_egg_ghost.png
@preview ../previews/creature_egg_ghost_x4.png 4
@columns 5

